cle cx="200.3" cy="126.2" r="14.3" fill="#6f8f5f"/><circle cx="223.7" cy="126.2" r="14.3" fill="#6f8f5f"/><circle cx="212" cy="110.6" r="18.2" fill="#6f8f5f"/><circle cx="206.8" cy="106.7" r="9.1" fill="#87a570"/><rect x="174.2" y="131" width="3.6" height="9" fill="#91592b"/><path d="M176 113L188.6 132.8H163.4Z" fill="#6f8f5f"/><path d="M176 104L185.9 122H166.1Z" fill="#6f8f5f"/><path d="M176 96.8L183.2 112.1H168.8Z" fill="#6f8f5f"/><circle cx="65.2" cy="120" r="6.4" fill="#87a570"/><circle cx="74" cy="118.4" r="7.2" fill="#87a570"/><circle cx="70.8" cy="115.2" r="3.2" fill="#adc391"/><circle cx="155.8" cy="116" r="5.6" fill="#87a570"/><circle cx="163.5" cy="114.6" r="6.3" fill="#87a570"/><circle cx="160.7" cy="111.8" r="2.8" fill="#adc391"/><rect x="150" y="118" width="4" height="22" fill="#2a3040"/><rect x="146" y="112" width="12" height="7" rx="2" fill="#2a3040"/><rect x="148" y="114" width="8" height="3" fill="#f3d6b1"/><path d="M54 168l-4 -8M60 170l2 -9M198 172l-3 -8" fill="none" stroke="#6f8f5f" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><strong>Walking trails</strong><span class="c3ph-t">Paths through the neighborhood</span></li></ul><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The city's community center is about a minute away by car. On weekdays you can play indoor pickleball there for a few dollars a day. Behind it are outdoor pickleball courts that are free and always open.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The center also has fitness classes, such as gentle yoga, that you pay for by the class. The city's recreation department runs trips for adults too, such as a monthly day trip around the Carolinas and bus tours.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="where-is-del-webb-north-myrtle-beach"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3" data-toc="Where it is">Where is Del Webb North Myrtle Beach?</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Del Webb North Myrtle Beach is inside the city of North Myrtle Beach, about a mile from the ocean. The beach is on the other side of US 17, the main highway.</p><div class="c3-aerial"><figure class="c3ph-hero" style=""><div class="c3ph-f"><img src="/images/55-plus/del-webb-north-myrtle-beach/del-webb-north-myrtle-beach-to-the-beach-2026-1200w.webp" srcset="/images/55-plus/del-webb-north-myrtle-beach/del-webb-north-myrtle-beach-to-the-beach-2026-600w.webp 600w, /images/55-plus/del-webb-north-myrtle-beach/del-webb-north-myrtle-beach-to-the-beach-2026-1200w.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1136px" width="1200" height="675" alt="North Myrtle Beach from the air with three labels: the beach and ocean at the left, US 17 running down the middle past blocks of beach houses and ball fields, and Del Webb North Myrtle Beach with its curving streets and ponds at the right" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="c3ph-cr"><a href="https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/USCODE-2023-title17/html/USCODE-2023-title17-chap1-sec105.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="U.S. government aerial photo. License: Public domain" title="License: Public domain">U.S. government aerial photo</a></span></div><figcaption>From the air: the beach, US 17 and Del Webb North Myrtle Beach.</figcaption></figure></div><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">In our experience, rush hour adds 5 to 10 minutes to the drive times on the map.</p><figure style="margin:1.8rem 0;max-width:760px"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" id="c3r-del-webb-north-myrtle-be" viewBox="0 0 360 337" width="360" height="337" role="img" aria-label="Del Webb North Myrtle Beach is in North Myrtle Beach, about 4 minutes from the beach, northeast of Myrtle Beach. The map also shows McLeod Health Seacoast, about