><li><span class="i"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M2.5 4H5l2.2 10.5h10.3L19.6 7H6"/><circle cx="9" cy="19" r="1.6"/><circle cx="16.5" cy="19" r="1.6"/></svg></span><span><strong>Publix</strong><span class="t">About 5 minutes</span></span></li><li><span class="i"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 3h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v14a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2zM12 7.5v9M7.5 12h9"/></svg></span><span><strong>Hospital</strong><span class="t">About 8 minutes</span></span></li><li><span class="i"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 16v-4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h10.5l2 5M14.5 11l4-7H21M8.5 17.5h4M2 21.5h20"/><circle cx="6.5" cy="17.5" r="2"/><circle cx="14.5" cy="17.5" r="2"/></svg></span><span><strong>Lawn care</strong><span class="t">In the HOA fee</span></span></li></ul></div><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem">By <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Devin Day</strong>, Operations Officer &middot; Reviewed by <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Tim Nash</strong>, Broker-in-Charge &middot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">Updated October 29, 2026</span></p><p class="detail-sub">Seasons has about 440 homes, most on one level, on curving streets around ponds near Murrells Inlet.</p></div></div><section style="background:var(--ivory)"><div class="wrap"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">The short answer</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Owners in Seasons at Prince Creek West share a clubhouse with an indoor pool, an outdoor pool and a fitness center, plus tennis and bocce. The neighborhood is south of Myrtle Beach.</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">At least one person in each home must be 55 or older and live there six months of the year or more. Grandchildren under 18 can come to stay for up to 60 days a year.</p><div style="margin-top:1.4rem"><a class="btn btn-brass btn-lg" href="/contact/">Talk to an agent</a></div><nav aria-label="On this page" style="margin-top:2rem;max-width:720px"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.3rem;font-weight:600">On this page</p><ul style="list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0"><li><a href="#what-is-there-to-do-in-seasons-at-prince-creek-west" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Things to do</a></li><li><a href="#where-is-seasons-at-prince-creek-west" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Where it is</a></li><li><a href="#what-are-the-homes-like-in-seasons" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">The homes</a></li><li><a href="#can-you-live-in-seasons-part-of-the-year" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35">Living here part-time</a></li><li><a href="#what-does-it-cost-to-live-in-seasons" style="display:block;padding:.65rem 0;color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:.18em;line-height:1.35"