+<main id="main"><div class="detail-hero bg-grid"><div class="wrap"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/buyers/">Buyers</a><span>/</span><span style="color:var(--muted)">Gated Communities</span></div><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:1rem">Gated communities</p><h1 class="detail-h1">Where are the gated communities near Myrtle Beach?<br/><em style="font-style:italic;color:var(--brass)">From the Cherry Grove marsh to the ocean at DeBordieu.</em></h1><p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:1rem">By <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Devin Day</strong>, Operations Officer &middot; Reviewed by <strong style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:600">Tim Nash</strong>, Broker-in-Charge &middot; <span style="white-space:nowrap">Updated October 29, 2026</span></p><p class="detail-sub">Two of these gated communities sit on the ocean, and ten have golf.</p></div></div><section style="background:var(--ivory)"><div class="wrap"><p style="font-family:var(--sans);font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brass);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600">The short answer</p><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">These 18 gated neighborhoods run from North Myrtle Beach to DeBordieu Colony, south of Pawleys Island. Most of them are on a golf course or on the water. Homes in them usually sell for about $200,000 to about $2 million, and most homeowners association (HOA) fees are about $95 to $400 a month.</p></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="choose"><div class="wrap"><style id="c3-glass">main#main{--g-ink:#8a5226;--g-ink-lg:#a8612c;--g-edge:rgba(255,255,255,.8);--g-hi:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.95);--g-sh:0 1px 2px rgba(28,32,40,.05),0 14px 36px -20px rgba(28,32,40,.3);--g-r:20px;--g-blur:saturate(150%) blur(16px);background-color:#f8f4ee;background-image:radial-gradient(44rem 26rem at 4% 460px,rgba(232,201,154,.30),rgba