eight:600;text-decoration:none" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Maryland Technical Bulletin 51</a>, <a href="https://dor.sc.gov/news/information-about-h-4216" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none" rel="noopener" target="_blank">South Carolina 2026 income tax</a>, <a href="https://taxfoundation.org/data/all/state/property-taxes-by-state-county/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Tax Foundation property taxes</a>, <a href="https://www.census.gov/quickfacts/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Census QuickFacts</a>, <a href="https://www.zillow.com/research/data/" style="color:var(--brass);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Zillow research data</a>. We are not tax advisers; rates change and your situation decides the answer. Verify with a professional before you plan around any of it.</p></div></section>
 
