olid var(--rule);color:var(--muted)">Rental rules at that address</td><td style="padding:.55rem .8rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);color:var(--muted)">Whether nightly rentals are allowed there, by city and zone. <a href="/invest/str-rules/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">The rules by city</a>.</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:.55rem .8rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);color:var(--muted)">Building financing, for a condo</td><td style="padding:.55rem .8rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);color:var(--muted)">Whether lenders finance that building. <a href="/invest/condotel-financing/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">Condotel financing</a>.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--ivory-2)" id="run-form"><div class="wrap"><h2 style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.7rem;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:1rem;line-height:1.3">What should you send?</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">The address is enough. Everything else helps.</p><ul style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin:0 0 1rem 1.3rem;padding:0"><li style="margin-bottom:.5rem">The address, or the MLS number.</li><li style="margin-bottom:.5rem">Your plan: long-term rental, short-term rental, mid-term rental or fix and flip. Not sure is fine.</li><li style="margin-bottom:.5rem">How you plan to pay, cash or a loan. We do not need your finances to run the property. <a href="/invest/cash-to-close/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">What you pay at closing, beyond the down payment</a>.</li><li style="margin-bottom:.5rem">Whether you will stay in it yourself. More than 14 nights a year changes the tax treatment. <a href="/invest/14-day-rule/" style="color:var(--navy);text-decoration:underline">The 14-day rule</a>.</li><li style="margin-bottom:.5rem">Anything you already have: a rent history, the dues, a prior inspection.</li></ul><div 